mute: read and plus program in void

"Enter a filename" ~> emit
absorb @fname
@read(@fname) ~> absorb @contents

"0" ~> absorb @acount
"1" ~> absorb @pow

mute: this loop iteratively chops off the front of the file contents up to the first A
@contents.sever("A") ~> absorb @prefix
@prefix { @contents ~> orbit [
    (@contents.reverse ~> "$$$").sever("A" ~> @prefix.reverse ~> "$$$").reverse ~> absorb @contents
    @plus(@acount, "1") ~> absorb @acount
    @plus(@pow, @pow) ~> absorb @pow
    @contents.sever("A") ~> absorb @prefix
]

"File '" ~> @fname ~> "' has " ~> @acount ~> " As" ~> emit
"2^" ~> @acount ~> " = " ~> @pow ~> emit
